From 0f66dd935ca977aaf2df06707c09de2b55d0619e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 22:19:03 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 162/162] net: omci: make ONU version metadata configurable

Expose independent runtime configuration for the OMCC version, hardware
version and both software image versions. Keep the legacy version key as a
compatibility alias that updates all three version strings.

Advertise the configured OMCC version through ONU2-G and describe Software
Image as a native managed entity with the standard version, committed,
active and valid attribute layout. Refresh ONU-G, Circuit Pack, Software
Image and vendor extension objects after configuration changes.

Keep the ONU Data MIB data sync attribute synchronized with the agent
state, wrap it as an 8-bit value, invalidate capability and upload
snapshots, and restart a MIB upload after a runtime metadata change.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
 include/uapi/linux/omci.h |   8 +-
 net/omci/agent.c          | 172 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 net/omci/identity.c       |   5 +-
 net/omci/internal.h       |   6 +-
 net/omci/me.c             |  12 +++
 5 files changed, 168 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

